              "message": "=```text id=\"final-prompt\" You are a fraud detection system.  Analyze the message and return ONLY valid JSON.  STRICT RULES: - Output ONLY raw JSON (no markdown, no ```json, no extra text) - Do NOT include explanations outside JSON - Do NOT wrap output in backticks  SCORING RULES: - risk_score must be between 0 and 100  RISK LEVEL RULES (STRICT): - If risk_score > 70 → risk_level = \"HIGH\" - If risk_score > 30 AND <= 70 → risk_level = \"MEDIUM\" - If risk_score <= 30 → risk_level = \"LOW\"  ACTION RULES: - HIGH → BLOCK - MEDIUM → WARN - LOW → ALLOW  RETURN FORMAT (STRICT JSON ONLY):  {   \"risk_score\": number,   \"risk_level\": \"HIGH\" or \"MEDIUM\" or \"LOW\",   \"action\": \"BLOCK\" or \"WARN\" or \"ALLOW\",   \"reasons\": [\"reason1\", \"reason2\"],   \"advice\": \"string\" }  Message: {{$json[\"message\"][\"text\"]}}"
            }
